[Heading1]	Aged care approval
[Heading2]	Eligibility
[OPM-conclusion]	the person's age at assessment = YearDifference(the person's date of birth, the assessment date)
[OPM-conclusion]	the person is eligible for approval as a care recipient if
[OPM-level1]	the person's age at assessment >= 65 or
[OPM-level1]	all
[OPM-level2]	the person's age at assessment >= 50 and
[OPM-level2]	the person is an Aboriginal or Torres Strait Islander person
[OPM-level1]	or
[OPM-level1]	the person has a condition of disability, frailty or other care need
[Heading2]	The approval
[OPM-conclusion]	the approval was made in time if
[OPM-level1]	the approval date >= the assessment date and
[OPM-level1]	DayDifference(the assessment date, the approval date) <= 30
[OPM-conclusion]	the approval is time-limited if
[OPM-level1]	the approval type = "Residential respite care" or
[OPM-level1]	the approval type = "Short-term restorative care"
[OPM-conclusion]	the approval end date = AddMonths(the approval date, 12) if
[OPM-level1]	the approval is time-limited
[OPM-conclusion]	the person has entered care before the end of the approval if
[OPM-level1]	the date of entry into care <= the approval end date
[OPM-conclusion]	the approval has lapsed if
[OPM-level1]	the approval is time-limited and
[OPM-level1]	the current date > the approval end date and
[OPM-level1]	the person has not entered care before the end of the approval
[OPM-conclusion]	the approval is valid if
[OPM-level1]	the person is eligible for approval as a care recipient and
[OPM-level1]	the approval was made in time and
[OPM-level1]	the approval has not lapsed and
[OPM-level1]	the approval has not been revoked
[OPM-conclusion]	the days until the approval ends = DayDifference(the current date, the approval end date) if
[OPM-level1]	the approval is time-limited and
[OPM-level1]	the current date <= the approval end date
[Heading2]	Respite
[OPM-conclusion]	the respite stay length = DayDifference(the respite stay start date, the respite stay end date) + 1
[OPM-conclusion]	the respite days used = InstanceSum(the person's respite stays, the respite stay length)
[OPM-conclusion]	the respite days remaining = Maximum(63 - the respite days used, 0) if
[OPM-level1]	the approval type = "Residential respite care"
